      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pimmit_Hills%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After decades of farm fields, Pimmit Hills was subdivided in the 1950s, with George Offutt building the first 500 homes for WWII and Korean War veterans.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20,
        21,
        23
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
