      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pimmit_Hills%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Tysons‑Pimmit Regional Library, operated by Fairfax County Public Library, serves both Pimmit Hills and nearby Tysons Corner.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pimmit_Hills%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Fairfax Water acquired the former Pimmit Hills water site in 1960 and later deeded it to the Park Authority in 1997 for a water‑line easement.",
